    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "order": 161,
    "anchor": "achieving-secondary-missions-4",
    "summary": "At the end of every turn, both players resolve these steps, the active player first:\n\n1. For each Secondary Mission whose conditions you met, you can take its VP. If you do and you use Tactical Missions, discard that card as achieved.\n2. On your own turn, if you use Tactical Missions, you can discard 1 or more active Secondary Missions to gain 1 CP.",
